-# Deposits this person started and never confirmed. Rendered only when there are
-# any: an empty state here would be a permanent panel about a state most
-# depositors never reach, and the page's two columns already carry their own.
-#
-# Placed above the workspace/published split because it is the only actionable
-# thing on the page — every row is waiting on this person. The caution tone
-# matches the "In progress" result pill.
-#
-# Finish deposit goes to the metadata step, not Edit: an unfinished deposit
-# refuses Edit by design, and the metadata step is the route that completes it.
.my-drs-card.bg-white.border.rounded-3.overflow-hidden.shadow-sm.mb-4
  .my-drs-card__head.p-3
    %h5.mb-1
      %i.fa-solid.fa-circle-exclamation.text-warning.me-2{ 'aria-hidden' => 'true' }
      Deposits to finish
    %p.small.text-muted.mb-0
      Only you and repository staff can see these until you finish them.
  .table-responsive
    %table.table.table-borderless.admin-registry-table
      %thead
        %tr
          %th{ scope: 'col' } File
          %th.text-end{ scope: 'col' } Finish
      %tbody
        - unfinished.each do |work|
          %tr
            %td.admin-registry-table__name
              %i.fa-regular.fa-file.text-muted.me-2{ 'aria-hidden' => 'true' }
              = Array(work['title_tsim']).first.presence || '(untitled)'
            %td.text-end
              = link_to metadata_work_path(work), class: 'btn btn-sm btn-warning' do
                %i.fa-solid.fa-pen-to-square.me-1{ 'aria-hidden' => 'true' }
                Finish deposit
